!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam maxMessageSize 235
skinparam DefaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #555555
    ArrowFontName SansSerif
    ArrowFontSize 11
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ParticipantBorderColor transparent
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #34495E
    ParticipantFontName SansSerif
    ParticipantFontSize 13
    ParticipantFontColor white
    BoxBorderColor transparent
    BoxFontName SansSerif
    BoxFontSize 11
    BoxFontColor #6F8592
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontName SansSerif
    FontSize 11
    FontColor #424242
}

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 15
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ParticipantPadding 35
hide footbox

title A Pod arrives before its Job watch exists
box "Exporter process" #F5F7FB
participant "Shared informers\nread Kubernetes API" as I #4263EB
participant "Controller\nstarts watches and queues work" as C #0B7285
participant "Discovery\nrecords owners and resolves roots" as D #7048E8
end box

note over I,D #F1F3F5
team-a: Pod train-workers-1-0 -> Job train-workers-1 -> JobSet train
The JobSet watch is ready. The Job watch has not started.
end note

== A. Record the Pod and its owner ==
I -[#4263EB]> C : Pod add event
C -> D : Upsert(Pod reference, ownerReferences)
note right of D
Remember Job UID -> Pod UID.
The Job has not arrived yet.
end note
D --> C : ChangeSet.MissingCoverage\nJob (batch/v1), namespace team-a
note over C,D
Watch setup and Pod reconciliation are queued separately.
If Resolve runs before the Job watch is ready, it returns
CoverageError(Job, ErrPending). The controller retries later.
end note

== B. Load the missing Job ==
C -> I : Start shared Job metadata LIST / WATCH\nin namespace team-a
I -[#4263EB]> C : Job add event\nownerReferences names JobSet train
C -> D : Upsert(Job reference, ownerReferences)
D --> C : ChangeSet.Objects: waiting Pod
note over I,C
Wait for the initial objects and their add handlers.
The Pod is queued again.
end note
C -> D : CoverageChanged(Job watch ready)

== C. Resolve the Pod ==
C -> D : Resolve(Pod reference)
D -[#0CA678]> C : GenericWorkload\nRoot(): JobSet train\nPath: Pod -> Job -> JobSet
note over C,D #E6FCF5
The Pod's workload is known.
Status and component mapping are evaluated afterward.
end note
@enduml
